  "question": "If ' Z ' denotes 'addition', ' X ' denotes 'multiplication', ' Y ' denotes 'division', and ' W ' denotes 'subtraction', then what will be the value of the following expression?\n\n15 Y (11 Z 4) Z 3 X 4 (19 Z 3) Y 11 X 3 (3 Z 2)",
