  "solution": "BODMAS rule:-\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nDecoding the information, \n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Sign**\n\n \n \n \n**Z**\n\n \n \n \n**X**\n\n \n \n \n**Y**\n\n \n \n \n**W**\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Means**\n\n \n \n \n**+**\n\n \n \n \n**×**\n\n \n \n \n**÷**\n\n \n \n \n**-**\n\n \n \n \n\nGiven:\n\n15 Y (11 Z 4) Z 3 X 4 (19 Z 3) Y 11 X 3 (3 Z 2)\n\nAfter replacing the signs from left to right and using the BODMAS rule,\n\n= 15 ÷ __**(11 + 4)**__ + 3 × 4 **__(19 + 3)__** ÷ 11 × 3 **__(3 + 2)__**\n\n= __**15 ÷ 15**__ + 3 × 4 × **__22 ÷ 11__** × 3 × 5\n\n= 1 + 3 × 4 × 2 × __**3 × 5**__\n\n= 1 + 3 × 4 × __**2 × 15**__\n\n= 1 + **__3 × 4 × 30__**\n\n= __**1 + 360**__\n\n= 361\n\nHence, **“361”** is the correct answer",
